---------- 8. PLL Usage Summary (begin) ----------

Instance Name                 : pll0
Resource                      : PLL_0
Reference Clock Resource      : GPIOL_20
Reset Pin Name                : pll_resetn
Locked Pin Name               : locked
Reference Clock Frequency     : 50.0000 MHz
Reference Clock Period        : 20.0000 ns
Multiplier (M)                : 25
Pre-Divider (N)               : 2
VCO Frequency                 : 625.0000 MHz
Post-Divider (O)              : 1
PLL Frequency                 : 625.0000 MHz

Output Clock 0
Clock Pin Name                : Fclk
Output Divider                : 4
Output Frequency              : 156.2500 MHz
Output Period                 : 6.400 ns

Output Clock 2
Clock Pin Name                : Sclk
Output Divider                : 8
Output Frequency              : 78.1250 MHz
Output Period                 : 12.800 ns

Frequency calculations:
	VCO = REFCLK * (M/N)
	    = 50.0000 MHz * (25/2)
	    = 625.0000 MHz
	PLL = VCO / O
	    = 625.0000 MHz / 1
	    = 625.0000 MHz

	CLKOUT0 = PLL / CLKOUT0_DIV
	        = 625.0000 MHz / 4
	        = 156.2500 MHz
	CLKOUT2 = PLL / CLKOUT2_DIV
	        = 625.0000 MHz / 8
	        = 78.1250 MHz

SDC Constraints:
	create_clock -period 6.400 -name Fclk [get_ports {Fclk}]
	create_clock -period 12.800 -name Sclk [get_ports {Sclk}]

---------- PLL Usage Summary (end) ----------

